<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall 314 mln markka in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall 314 mln markka in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to June 23 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to June 13:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 59,200	59,513</p>
<p> Money market intervention     9,558	 9,558</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,921	 1,916</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,909	 1,909</p>
<p> Other				 7,955	 7,699</p>
<p> Total assets		     80,543	80,595</p>
<p>In the previous week, to June 13, reserves fell by 1.05 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 248, news@reuters.fi</p>
